Give the reader **one write leg**: leg 5 = `open_panel(WORK)` → `add_shift_reg(#23032, y =` the loop's own measured vertical midpoint `)` → read `Tunnel` + the GObject uid set. One call converts an unfalsifiable census into a decisive experiment. As specified, the five-leg reader cannot come back wrong, which is the same as saying it cannot come back informative.

